      <MissionDesc>We are dedicated to bringing hope and a better quality of life to the children and youth of Elma Barnett Children's Centre in Kamonong, Kenya. Our sponsorship program aims to show love and compassion through education, food and shelter, and healthy living. We also maintain and improve the land and buildings needed to support these efforts. Our goal is to empower children and youth to become adults with integrity who are self-sufficient and responsible members of Kenyan society.</MissionDesc>
